  <item>
    <title>Welcome to your blueprint!</title>
    <wp:post_id>101</wp:post_id>
    <wp:post_type>post</wp:post_type>
    <wp:status>publish</wp:status>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You've just opened a blueprint! You can review information on blueprints <a href="https://wordpress.github.io/wordpress-playground/blueprints">here</a>, or experiment by changing lines in the blueprint builder and running again. When you've made a blueprint you like, save it!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
